{"4425120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greetings from El Rey", "steam_appid": 4425120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/898ccedcd03d21496640ab0502bc2144.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/898ccedcd03d21496640ab0502bc2144.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/898ccedcd03d21496640ab0502bc2144.mp4?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Greetings from El Rey</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong><i><u>noir 2.5D platformer</u></i></strong> in which a paranoid detective explores a sealed city through a <strong><i><u>rotating 2D perspective</u></i></strong>, engaged in an obsessive hunt for the <strong><i><u>mysterious R.</u></i></strong>  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/6914c6f485a8c4e85ed22f901a2bcc33.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/6914c6f485a8c4e85ed22f901a2bcc33.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/6914c6f485a8c4e85ed22f901a2bcc33.mp4?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore an intricate <u><i><strong>three-dimensional labyrinth</strong></i></u>, solve <u><i><strong>spatial puzzles</strong></i></u> and master <u><i><strong>challenging sections</strong></i></u>, adapting classic platforming mechanics with world rotation. <strong><i><u>Confront bosses</u></i></strong> that warp the world outside the playfield, where your weapons are movement, timing and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/885948766467867e110c83d5dc4f0644.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/885948766467867e110c83d5dc4f0644.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/885948766467867e110c83d5dc4f0644.mp4?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/4ce4bd7b0bb1e5233d8b1e5c963d79db.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/4ce4bd7b0bb1e5233d8b1e5c963d79db.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/4ce4bd7b0bb1e5233d8b1e5c963d79db.mp4?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A singular, <u><i><strong>diegetic external layout</strong></i></u> that interacts with gameplay and story, providing <u><i><strong>context  and meaning</strong></i></u> to every player action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/349a539d1984563d9b846b9eb8c002a2.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/349a539d1984563d9b846b9eb8c002a2.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/349a539d1984563d9b846b9eb8c002a2.mp4?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>El Rey has two rules</strong></i></u>. Entry demands a <u><i><strong>high price</strong></i></u>. Once inside, you <u><i><strong>never get out</strong></i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here Satrapo pursues R., a phantom shaped by discordant stories, navigating <u><i><strong>eccentric figures</strong></i></u>, <u><i><strong>erratic prophecies</strong></i></u> and above all, <u><i><strong>a city built on lies</strong>.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings from El Rey is a <u><i><strong>paranoid tale</strong></i></u> about desire, always shifting and reshaping the protagonist’s point of view. It is a <u><i><strong>psychedelic noir</strong></i></u> questioning the very possibility of meaning and what it costs to keep looking for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/489ad9822da4912a61194d98be1f4baf.poster.avif?t=1783332772\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/489ad9822da4912a61194d98be1f4baf.webm?t=1783332772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4425120/extras/489ad9822da